--[[
		ABOUT(READ THIS)

This admin requires no editing of the script for use. Just put it in your place and play.
Things save with this admin, bans, admins, settings, chatlogs and logs.
You can access the settings to disable most features such as donate, custom chat, custom leaderboard and more.
To access settings go ingame and say 'settings'.
If you are confused about how to use this admin go ingame and use the ':help' command.
If you have any issues or help isn't useful PM me and I'll assist you to the best of my ability.

